  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/74ba2f619b45b01e3a5f07bb5d4cbf2cf1c616c0.png\" alt=\"Unusual Furniture 标志\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/addons/unusual-furniture-bedrock-edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d84d9889c30abb86e739ae0654006b58c3c1fca4.png\" alt=\"也有基岩版\"></a></p>\n<p>是否一直想要一款品质优良且带有原版风格的家具模组？Unusual Furniture 正是为你打造的模组！体验全新的家具、建筑方块、装饰品以及更多内容。大部分家具都具备互动功能。</p>\n<p>以下是一些截图！<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dc1cd2a2c394161d759c1cbb44ca0ce920d962d2.png\" alt=\"桌子\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://to0pa.ovh/modimages/woord.png\" alt=\"木材\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://to0pa.ovh/modimages/pouet.png\" alt=\"植物与沙发\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/47ba41db13d94417d6bd33565e7c687d87bfd7f9.png\" alt=\"1.1 更新\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/73917bb7376c7fb7e8a6bf473bd65c2292110c25.png\" alt=\"1.2 更新\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://to0pa.ovh/modimages/interior_house.png\" alt=\"画廊图片1\"> 喜欢这个建筑作品吗？快去查看画廊吧！<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unusual-furniture/gallery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3944ed3657cb76f655015e8b75f8e0e121345d76.png\" alt=\"画廊按钮\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8988384b999fb71a092a1ca682b513f1ecf519ac.png\" alt=\"兼容性\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/k3fGJwJqzu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e7d437cbe00c4c4d693900b0e41e3a293a84a31b.png\" alt=\"Discord 链接\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fto0pa.net%252fdonate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e79bfe6b479f2a23fad07b79b13d88d027ae422e.png\" alt=\"捐赠\"></a></p>\n<p>==== 赞助商 ====</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fwrench\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/060ea25c304c36bb48e61db95e82269d2bc69c2a.png\" alt=\"赞助商\"></a></p>",
